compliance with all related environmental laws and implementing regulations.;Provide additional offices, vehicles, tools, and equipment for wildlife inspectors to conduct their duties.;Transfer the Project back to NCW at the end of Contract Period.;Train and deploy qualified wildlife inspectors across the 14 Points of Entry and all wildlife outlets.;Adhere to standards (i.e., CITES), checklists, and standard operating procedures to perform inspections safely and
efficiently.;

